  tf.math.reduce_euclidean_norm(y, 1)  # [sqrt(14), sqrt(3)]
  tf.math.reduce_euclidean_norm(y, 1, keepdims=True)  # [[sqrt(14)], [sqrt(3)]]
  tf.math.reduce_euclidean_norm(y, [0, 1])  # sqrt(17)
  ```

